data: {"id": "aacc8341da3446d2-thinking-parallel_evidence-597", "run_id": "aacc8341da3446d2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据结论\n\n**实体身份**：`aiops-case-v14/workload` (UID: `88142b75...`)，调度至 `node2`，单容器 `app`，当前状态 **Pending** / `ContainerCreating`。\n\n**根因事实（支持）**：\n1.  **Events 决定性证据**：kubelet 明确报错 `failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]`。\n2.  **配置上下文**：Pod YAML 包含注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net`，说明该 Pod 使用 Multus CNI 尝试挂载一个名为 `secondary-net` 的二次网络，该网络声明依赖 `aiops-unavailable` 类型的 CNI 插件。\n3.  **指标验证**：Prometheus `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 显示 `reaso", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789374273689, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

